# Cloudflare Pages response headers (this file is not served). The holder console asks a wallet to sign and send:
# no other site may frame it (a framed page can steer taps), and scripts are only run with a JavaScript MIME type.
# Cloudflare Pages 响应头（本文件不会被提供）。持有人操作台会请钱包签名和发交易：不允许任何其他网站把它嵌进框架
# （被嵌入的页面可以诱导点击），脚本只按 JavaScript 类型执行。
#
# Pages applies EVERY rule whose path matches and joins a header set twice with a comma. So /* sets no
# Content-Security-Policy: each page sets exactly one of its own below. X-Frame-Options DENY still covers every path.
# Only /console/* restricts scripts (all of its scripts are files: site/console/*.js); the other pages may have inline
# scripts, so they only forbid framing. sdk/test/console.test.mjs checks that every page ends with exactly one policy.
# Pages 会应用所有匹配的规则，同一个头设了两次会用逗号拼起来。所以 /* 不设 CSP，每个页面在下面各设一条。
# X-Frame-Options DENY 仍覆盖所有路径。只有 /console/* 限制脚本（它的脚本都是文件）；其他页面可能有内联脚本，只禁止嵌入框架。
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

/
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'

/docs/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'

/playground/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'

# The vendored SDK imports its own modules without a content stamp (so one module is never loaded under two URLs), so a
# browser must revalidate them on every load: with the default 4-hour cache a release could pair a new index.js with a
# cached ai.js. Revalidation is one 304 per unchanged file. / vendor 内部导入不带内容戳（避免同一模块两个网址），浏览器每次
# 都要重新验证：默认缓存 4 小时，发版后可能出现新的 index.js 配旧的 ai.js。未变的文件只多一次 304。
/playground/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/status/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'

/dashboard/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'

# The receipt checker restricts its scripts with a <meta> policy in the page itself (sdk/test/console.test.mjs keeps
# script-src out of this file for every page but the console). / 回执核验页在页面内用 <meta> 限制脚本。
/verify/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'

# The privacy page (a draft) also sets its script policy with a <meta> in the page. / 隐私页（草稿）同样在页面内用 <meta> 设脚本策略。
/privacy/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'

/console/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https:; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'
